  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "击败怪物收集能量，再用能量开启地图宝箱找装备，强化后进入下一波战斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Beat cute yet silly mobs → Collect energy → Explore the map (hunt for gear) → Brawl with the next wave of cute creeps! Earn energy by defeating monsters to unlock in-map treasure chests, gain gear, boost your combat power, stop the evil Dimensional Reaper \"Chaos\", and restore cosmic order.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3767340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "法师、棒球手、狼人、机甲枪手和弓手拥有专属技能与被动，跨技能合理搭配可触发华丽高伤连招",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The game features a variety of characters with unique mechanics and traits for you to choose from! Mage: Master of powerful control magic Baseball Player: Swing with courage and strength Werewolf: Unleash primal fury and bloodthirsty instincts Mecha Warrior (Gunner): Wield heavy firepower Archer: Agile, graceful, and never misses a shot Each character boasts exclusive powerful skills and passive effects. Their skills can form clever synergies—rational combinations unlock gorgeous combos and devastating damage output!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3767340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用受损能量阵列碎片锻造支援伙伴，包括进攻Armed Cat、治疗Little Dragon和探索辅助Huaihuai",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Companion System: Immense vitality lies within the damaged energy arrays. Use shards of these arrays to forge your ultimate supportive allies—Offensive \"Armed Cat\", Healing \"Little Dragon\", and Exploration Support \"Huaihuai\"!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3767340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
